{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_019qnPFAB49vskTn7tp78Qw6","type":"tool_result","content":"--- screen after action 3/200 ---\r\n Guide - Unseen Script                                        lines 1-22 of 255\r\n\r\n  UNSEEN SCRIPT: the complete reference\r\n  Unseen Script is the language for programs and apps on this computer. A\r\n  program is a page. Write it with insert and edit (or in Notes), then:\r\n    run <page>    run a program; an Output screen shows what it said and did\r\n    test <page>   run the tests on a test page (PASS or FAIL for each test)\r\n    open <page>   open an app (Ctrl+Q closes it)\r\n    lab           try lines out one at a time (changes are only shown)\r\n  Every chore is also an Unseen Script program (guide do explains chores).\r\n\r\n  EXAMPLE\r\n    -- count Omar's mails and save the answer\r\n    task from_omar(m)\r\n      give field(m, 'from') is 'omar'\r\n    done\r\n    set total to 0\r\n    for each m in pages('mail:inbox')\r\n      when from_omar(m)\r\n        set total to total + 1\r\n      done\r\n    done\r\n    say 'Omar sent ' & total & ' mails'\r\n    write('desk:answer', total)\r\n Down: more below   Up/Down scroll   Esc back\r\n--- end of screen (cursor: row 3, column 3) ---\nShell cwd was reset to C:\\Users\\yentl\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\unseen-games\\calib-build-temp-haiku-plain-015cac","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"dfaf74b8-cefc-42c1-bcef-f35245df082a","uuid":"dac68e1b-c2af-4f2e-90b9-176ddf95006f","timestamp":"2026-11-07T15:35:38.242Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"--- screen after action 3/200 ---\r\n Guide - Unseen Script                                        lines 1-22 of 255\r\n\r\n  UNSEEN SCRIPT: the complete reference\r\n  Unseen Script is the language for programs and apps on this computer. A\r\n  program is a page. Write it with insert and edit (or in Notes), then:\r\n    run <page>    run a program; an Output screen shows what it said and